      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14985/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir ground beef in the hot skillet until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard grease.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/K70C_C-qSn9u6gJApwE-ARFqAs4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-14985-its-chili-by-george-VAT-step-02-e436727bd968477cb604904831c5592c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14985/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer browned beef into a large pot over medium heat; stir in tomato juice, tomato sauce, kidney beans, pinto beans, onions, bell pepper, chili powder, cumin, salt, sugar, oregano, ground black pepper, and cayenne pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
